It is a first-token signal. The model's first token of each document has no earlier text to
look back at, and this component writes a strongly negative value there:
- the first token of a document: about -5.5 if it is an English word (about -6.3 when
  capitalised), about -3.5 for punctuation, digits, spaces and CJK text;
